Ms670 is the memory for the 4300. The KA670-BA is the processor module. The
processor module comes with on-board DSSI (two buses) and on-board ethernet
(AUI and thinwire) as well as the console ports.

> On the metal panel are:
> A white knob, black switch and console port.  I think I understand these,

IIRC, the white knob is baud rate selection. The black switch enables BREAK
on the console. Hit BREAK (or F5) on a VT200 and the system halts and prints
the >>> prompt. If you're fast then the C (continue) command will commence
operations.

